          ${!supported ? `
          <div class="callout callout-amber mt-14">Automatic saving needs the File System Access API, currently supported in Chrome and Edge, opened directly from a folder on disk (not from inside a zip or a restricted viewer). You can still use manual Backup &amp; Restore below on any browser.</div>
